[node name="ShieldCase" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Asset P3.3: the Shield of Achilles under glass (\"Heel sold separately\"). Origin on the floor, facing +z. Built like the tall case: not cover, because the guard sees through the glass (group see_through) and the cabinet is only 0.8 m. A crowbar breaks the glass (loud); then the shield is the museum's richest loot."
